{"2672470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "UnLoop", "steam_appid": 2672470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/06c1e246943400e9db28cb12c375d05d.avif?t=1783534212\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras_big/06c1e246943400e9db28cb12c375d05d.webp?t=1783534212 width=1560 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>UnLoop</strong> – the most chaotic VR game out there. You need a highly coordinated squad to survive this space station. The catch? <strong>YOU ARE</strong> <strong>THAT SQUAD.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time the loop resets, your replica is left behind to repeat your exact physical movements, gestures, and voice in real-time. Yell instructions at your future-self, flip off your uncooperative past-self, and desperately try not to step on your own toes.<strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/5857402ed66ddd3f7fe752958ef3b9a7.poster.avif?t=1783534212\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/5857402ed66ddd3f7fe752958ef3b9a7.webm?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/5857402ed66ddd3f7fe752958ef3b9a7.mp4?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/7d1440d1ae4f695fc01d9b33c7050d2e.avif?t=1783534212\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras_big/7d1440d1ae4f695fc01d9b33c7050d2e.webp?t=1783534212 width=1560 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to argue with a room full of people who all sound exactly like you? You’ve come to the right place. After a few loops, you will be surrounded by your own past-copies, all screaming the same expletives at each other. They all disagree with you. And worst of all... they are technically correct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s chaotic, it’s loud, and yes – the voices in your head are entirely real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/d78b1c1052c02c0412802f1f39c02296.poster.avif?t=1783534212\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/d78b1c1052c02c0412802f1f39c02296.webm?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/d78b1c1052c02c0412802f1f39c02296.mp4?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/291498392c87a1433caeafa02ce7b073.avif?t=1783534212\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras_big/291498392c87a1433caeafa02ce7b073.webp?t=1783534212 width=1560 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruined the timeline? Didn’t catch a crucial item? No problem. Just raise your laser gun, shoot yourself, and instantly reset the loop. Or shoot your copy who made a bad throw, you are the original one anyway!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death isn't a failure here. It's just a tactical undo button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/0987a40d4e0945ee284fbe0776dfb6ba.poster.avif?t=1783534212\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/0987a40d4e0945ee284fbe0776dfb6ba.webm?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/0987a40d4e0945ee284fbe0776dfb6ba.mp4?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/e211233eab7a82fffbd4d8f8d022a141.avif?t=1783534212\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras_big/e211233eab7a82fffbd4d8f8d022a141.webp?t=1783534212 width=1560 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle is solved by coordinating with your past actions. Which sounds brilliant, until you realize your past-self had no idea what they were doing either.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the sheer, unadulterated ego trip of figuring things out all by yourself. When you finally spend 15 minutes coordinating three of your past-copies just to pass a single keycard through a door, you’ll feel like an absolute mastermind solving the mysteries of the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’ll let you have that. You’re welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/1172be50f9646f0881065ea8f12cae37.poster.avif?t=1783534212\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/1172be50f9646f0881065ea8f12cae37.webm?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/1172be50f9646f0881065ea8f12cae37.mp4?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/06c1e246943400e9db28cb12c375d05d.avif?t=1783534212\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras_big/06c1e246943400e9db28cb12c375d05d.webp?t=1783534212 width=1560 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>UnLoop</strong> – the most chaotic VR game out there. You need a highly coordinated squad to survive this space station. The catch? <strong>YOU ARE</strong> <strong>THAT SQUAD.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time the loop resets, your replica is left behind to repeat your exact physical movements, gestures, and voice in real-time. Yell instructions at your future-self, flip off your uncooperative past-self, and desperately try not to step on your own toes.<strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/5857402ed66ddd3f7fe752958ef3b9a7.poster.avif?t=1783534212\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/5857402ed66ddd3f7fe752958ef3b9a7.webm?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/5857402ed66ddd3f7fe752958ef3b9a7.mp4?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/7d1440d1ae4f695fc01d9b33c7050d2e.avif?t=1783534212\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras_big/7d1440d1ae4f695fc01d9b33c7050d2e.webp?t=1783534212 width=1560 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to argue with a room full of people who all sound exactly like you? You’ve come to the right place. After a few loops, you will be surrounded by your own past-copies, all screaming the same expletives at each other. They all disagree with you. And worst of all... they are technically correct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s chaotic, it’s loud, and yes – the voices in your head are entirely real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/d78b1c1052c02c0412802f1f39c02296.poster.avif?t=1783534212\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/d78b1c1052c02c0412802f1f39c02296.webm?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/d78b1c1052c02c0412802f1f39c02296.mp4?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/291498392c87a1433caeafa02ce7b073.avif?t=1783534212\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras_big/291498392c87a1433caeafa02ce7b073.webp?t=1783534212 width=1560 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruined the timeline? Didn’t catch a crucial item? No problem. Just raise your laser gun, shoot yourself, and instantly reset the loop. Or shoot your copy who made a bad throw, you are the original one anyway!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death isn't a failure here. It's just a tactical undo button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/0987a40d4e0945ee284fbe0776dfb6ba.poster.avif?t=1783534212\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/0987a40d4e0945ee284fbe0776dfb6ba.webm?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/0987a40d4e0945ee284fbe0776dfb6ba.mp4?t=1783534212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/e211233eab7a82fffbd4d8f8d022a141.avif?t=1783534212\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras_big/e211233eab7a82fffbd4d8f8d022a141.webp?t=1783534212 width=1560 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle is solved by coordinating with your past actions. Which sounds brilliant, until you realize your past-self had no idea what they were doing either.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the sheer, unadulterated ego trip of figuring things out all by yourself. When you finally spend 15 minutes coordinating three of your past-copies just to pass a single keycard through a door, you’ll feel like an absolute mastermind solving the mysteries of the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’ll let you have that. You’re welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672470/extras/1172be50f9646f0881065ea8f12cae37.poster.avif?t=1783534212\" width=1170 height=584 >